      {
        "component": "multiselect",
        "name": "classes",
        "label": "Style",
        "description": "Combine freely, e.g. Vertical + Pills. Accordion on mobile stacks the tabs below 600px. Specs lays out a spec comparison: give each tab a Fragment holding a Columns block (one column per model; row 1 the model names, every other cell a label and a value as two paragraphs). Locations shows each tab as an image tile: give each tab a city Title and one image as its Content; the open tab's image fills the section. FAQ puts text tabs above the accordions of a Light FAQ section: give each tab a Title, then add one Accordion block per tab after the Tabs block in the same section (the first accordion goes in the first tab, and so on), or give a tab a Fragment holding an Accordion.",
